{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قُلْنَا", "translation": "We said"}, {"text": "ٱدْخُلُوا۟", "translation": "Enter"}, {"text": "هَـٰذِهِ", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَرْيَةَ", "translation": "town"}, {"text": "فَكُلُوا۟", "translation": "then eat"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "حَيْثُ", "translation": "wherever"}, {"text": "شِئْتُمْ", "translation": "you wish[ed]"}, {"text": "رَغَدًۭا", "translation": "abundantly"}, {"text": "وَٱدْخُلُوا۟", "translation": "and enter"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَابَ", "translation": "the gate"}, {"text": "سُجَّدًۭا", "translation": "prostrating"}, {"text": "وَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "And say"}, {"text": "حِطَّةٌۭ", "translation": "Repentance"}, {"text": "نَّغْفِرْ", "translation": "We will forgive"}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "خَطَـٰيَـٰكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "your sins"}, {"text": "وَسَنَزِيدُ", "translation": "And We will increase"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ", "translation": "the good-doers (in reward)"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We said, \"Enter this city [i.e., Jerusalem] and eat from it wherever you will in [ease and] abundance, and enter the gate bowing humbly1 and say, 'Relieve us of our burdens [i.e., sins].' We will [then] forgive your sins for you, and We will increase the doers of good [in goodness and reward].\""}